        would otherwise render carousel arrows over a single slide). One
        splice covers slides, thumbnails, grid and the zoom dialog — all four
        iterate sorted_media. Supersedes hide_variants by construction. Gate:
        scripts/check-gallery-scope.mjs]
    - snippets/product-media-gallery-content.liquid#pdp-gallery-mobile-controls-ref
        [the mobile-only second slideshow-controls render passes the
        stock secondary param, so ref="slideshowControls" is emitted once
        instead of twice when the desktop and mobile pagination styles differ.
        Without it component.js keeps the last write and the Slideshow's
        slideshowControls ref resolves to the mobile element on every
        breakpoint. Gate: scripts/check-pdp-gallery-thumbnails.mjs]
    - snippets/product-media.liquid#perf-srcset [default widths list gains
