        'state') only — no cross-block sibling scan. An earlier version
        attempted to re-derive the native block_index when a sibling was
        server-skipped; deleted 2026-08-13 once measurement showed a
        sibling's .settings is unreadable from inside another block's own
        render in Horizon's theme-block architecture. block_index stays the
