    - blocks/_announcement.liquid#announcement-countdown-fallback [renders
        bmp-countdown in mode: 'fallback' (a <script> tag for
        assets/bmp-countdown-fallback.js) only when THIS block's own
        countdown state is 'hidden'. Placed AFTER the hide-wrap closes and
        BEFORE the native endunless — load-bearing, because inside the wrap
