        card-global-title-open. data-bmp-fit commits the title to one line in
        CSS from first paint (the "PDP title auto-fit + per-device size
        " group in assets/bmp-styles.css); the mobile size travels as
        an inline --bmp-title-size-mobile custom property (sanctioned §6
